      "difficulty": 1,
      "stem": "把 tileset 挂进 Cesium 场景的正确 API 是？",
      "explanation": "Cesium 三套容器各管一摊：影像 imageryLayers、实体 entities/dataSources、渲染原语 scene.primitives。3D Tiles 是渲染原语。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "title": "Cesium.Cesium3DTileset API 参考",
          "url": "https://cesium.com/reference/cesiumjs/latest/Cesium.Cesium3DTileset.html"
        }
      ],
      "type": "single",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "text": "viewer.imageryLayers.add(tileset)"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "viewer.entities.add(tileset)"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "viewer.scene.primitives.add(tileset)",
          "hint": "3D Tiles 属于渲染原语层"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "viewer.dataSources.add(tileset)"
        }
      ],
      "answer": [
        "C"
      ]
    },
